# Themes are built in and compared byte for byte (`yapfast theme new` writes
# the template's theme.json as it is), so their text keeps `\n` line ends in
# every checkout, Windows' `core.autocrlf` too. Pictures and sounds stay binary.
assets/themes/** text=auto eol=lf

# This signed test fixture must retain its exact bytes on Windows too.
src/update/testdata/sums.txt -text
